    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hup Hup and Away!</h2>Life is sweet with Hup Hup the Cupcake! With no bills, no worries, and no end in sight, Hup Hup spends his days roaming the blissful sky, hopping across grassy lumps in a dreamlike journey above the clouds. Leap between towering platforms in search of the sacred Finish Dish. Set your own challenge as you play through batches of procedurally generated levels with a quantity and difficulty of your choosing. Treat yourself to peace of mind, knowing you can always try again if you fall, and there will always be a new level to play when you finish. Welcome to the world of Hup Hup, where fun is a piece of cake!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have your Cake\u2026 and Cup it Too!</h2>Choose your number of levels in increments of 10, all the way up to 1000!<br><br>Set your minimum and maximum difficulty, so you can enjoy a sweet and simple ride, a trek with rising action, or a constant chocolatey challenge!<br><br>Or, set the level count to 0 to play forever, with an infinite chain of levels of random difficulty within your chosen range!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995710/extras/3cd3b2185996deb23486c62af6cfa4f4.avif?t=1717657381\" width=576 height=132 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If it Smells, Skip it!</h2>Don\u2019t like a level? Skip it in the pause menu to get a new one!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995710/extras/ced5817c4727d6c93f83e79376430391.avif?t=1717657381\" width=650 height=444 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hup Hup and Away!</h2>Life is sweet with Hup Hup the Cupcake! With no bills, no worries, and no end in sight, Hup Hup spends his days roaming the blissful sky, hopping across grassy lumps in a dreamlike journey above the clouds. Leap between towering platforms in search of the sacred Finish Dish. Set your own challenge as you play through batches of procedurally generated levels with a quantity and difficulty of your choosing. Treat yourself to peace of mind, knowing you can always try again if you fall, and there will always be a new level to play when you finish. Welcome to the world of Hup Hup, where fun is a piece of cake!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have your Cake\u2026 and Cup it Too!</h2>Choose your number of levels in increments of 10, all the way up to 1000!<br><br>Set your minimum and maximum difficulty, so you can enjoy a sweet and simple ride, a trek with rising action, or a constant chocolatey challenge!<br><br>Or, set the level count to 0 to play forever, with an infinite chain of levels of random difficulty within your chosen range!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995710/extras/3cd3b2185996deb23486c62af6cfa4f4.avif?t=1717657381\" width=576 height=132 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If it Smells, Skip it!</h2>Don\u2019t like a level? Skip it in the pause menu to get a new one!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995710/extras/ced5817c4727d6c93f83e79376430391.avif?t=1717657381\" width=650 height=444 /></span>",
